      <activity id="01dec713-f0ce-5a33-bdb4-f1ef7c1e2aec" activityNameId="96461009-8a6e-59b2-aa96-b19aa486097d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, residual mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, residual mix
The location and technology of the production of the residual attributes have been for some technologies (biomass, solar, hydropower) adapted by the ENTSO-mix based on technologies, which is a rough estimation.; UUID:d1d1da4e-872e-31a3-9232-364044fde30f
Includes the shares of residual attributes produced in Europe in 2019 with the different technologies. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to untracked electricity supplied in Switzerland.
Wind power plants are European averages.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d1d1da4e-872e-31a3-9232-364044fde30f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
